== structure: every P1/P2 number is a generic function of K = kappa/H (no feature at K = 1/Z) ==
   P1 C_P/S   = 2*((K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 3)/((K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 + 3)
   P2 C_P/S   = 2*((K + sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 3)/((K + sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 + 3)
   P1 PV/M    = (K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2/((K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 9)
   P1 TS/M    = 3*((K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 3)/(2*((K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 9))
   P1 G/M     = (-(K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 9)/(2*((K - sqrt(K**2 + 3))**2 - 9))
  ok   C_P/S at kappa_b = K equals -2K/sqrt(K^2+3) and at kappa_c = K equals +2K/sqrt(K^2+3) for EVERY K (so at K = 1/Z: -/+ 2/sqrt(1+32 pi) = -/+0.19849) 
  ok   the G/M = 1/2 - PV/M and TS/M = 1/2 + PV/M identities hold at P1 (Smarr; not a result) 

